          "text": "Rash history and progression"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports rash began as little clear blisters on the face and neck about 1–2 weeks ago, possibly longer, then spread everywhere; now multiple sore crusted areas on the face, neck, upper chest, some arms, and trunk."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
